<title>USA: 3Com cuts Fast Etherlink XL card price.</title>
<headline>3Com cuts Fast Etherlink XL card price.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>3Com Corp Monday said it cut prices on its Fast EtherLink XL 10/100 PCI network interface card, with the product now available for as low as $94.00 in 100 packs.</p>
<p>The price reductions, effective Tuesday, February 11, are expected to accelerate the growth of the Fast Ethernet NIC market, the company said.</p>
